# The pointer theme of the system (docs/POINTERS.md, section 5), under the
# license of the repository. Each shape is a grid of squares, in the style of
# the arrow of docs/DESIGN.md: "X" a black square, "." a white one, " "
# nothing. A square is size / 12 pixels: 2 at the size 24, 4 at 48. The
# option "hot" is in squares; the hot spot is the middle of its square.
theme System
license MIT
attribution The pointer theme of the system, drawn as grids of squares in resources/pointers/system.manifest.

sizes 24 48

